[{"title":"修竹篇","author":"何景明","text":"君不见真翁堂下竹贯日，干云千尺高亭亭。\n万木避霜色飒飒，空岩回翠涛平生。\n直节本无偶，手栽琅玕种琼玖。\n风月何曾忘此君，松梅况自称三友。\n东曹郎君翁所奇，节概更与翁名齐。\n神龙昔向沧波化，彩凤今从玉树栖。\n高堂兹辰开寿箓，却洗金盘对春竹。\n霓旌昼下仙人车，云管宵停嬴女曲。\n翁家旧住上林西，托根白近蓬莱池。\n雪崖冰柱映楼阁，雨露常沾万岁枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":66,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七夕词","author":"何景明","text":"双星渡河月西没，悲参怨商愁夜独。\n霄阑箕斗自低昂，心怜情恨看七襄。\n人生失意无贱贵，寒机织妇鸳鸯思，金屏玉瑟宫娥泪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":67,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同崔吕孙三内翰集徐子瞻辰楼","author":"何景明","text":"秋日徐君北楼上，北楼岧峣连北斗。\n窗牖临观日下花，阑干坐拂天中柳。\n南州孺子美如玉，北门词客同杯酒。\n咫尺金门接玉堂，碧霄共立空翘首。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":68,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚雨君卿招不赴","author":"何景明","text":"骑马出门还复入，六月阴晴不可卜。\n檐前星出乍有无，城上雨来时断续。\n炎天留客夜苦短，燕地近秋暑偏酷。\n何人同对寸中花，忆尔独伴啼乌宿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":69,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观石鼓歌","author":"何景明","text":"我来太学谒孔庙，下观戟门石鼓陈。\n之罘诅楚几埋没，此石照耀垂千春。\n苔昏藓涩读难下，虫彫鸟剥细不分。\n古画诘曲蛟龙隐，石气惨淡烟雾氛。\n周王功勋史籀笔，数石散落岐阳滨。\n中兴气象岂复睹，大篆意格谁曾闻。\n先秦文字稍近古，两汉摹拓多失真。\n六朝以来尚靡丽，钟王往往称通神。\n唐韩宋轼递歌叹，长篇险韵何悲辛。\n大观之间入汴国，君王好艺崇斯文。\n高驼巨舰远载玫，金填玉嵌传相珍。\n靖康乘舆忽播荡，保和玩物随烟尘。\n神驱鬼守散复聚，至宝岂得空沉沦。\n文皇北来定燕鼎，不置太庙留成均。\n博士无烦上书请，诸生颇得亲讲询。\n虚廊画壁安置稳，大厦长檐覆盖新。\n不随钟鼎怨磨灭，已与琬琰争嶙峋。\n平生博览爱古迹，世上墨本徒纷纭。\n此虽残缺岁已久，尚觉只字轻千缗。\n璧池日月动华衮，奎阁星斗罗贞珉。\n呜呼孔庙在万世，此石与庙长无湮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":70,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同李进士观铜雀砚歌","author":"何景明","text":"君不见邺中魏帝无宫殿，千秋遗瓦磨为砚。\n墨客骚人空叹嗟，朱薨绮构谁曾见。\n李君好古精鉴别，冬天拂拭开烟雪。\n虚堂叩之哀玉昔，泥沙洗出黄金屑。\n广州紫石鸲鹆眼，歙山龙尾何希罕。\n濡藻光回星汉垂，蟠花背刻龟螭断。\n共忆高台罗绮春，翠眉艳骨飞黄尘。\n提携故物悲年代，感慨新章泣鬼神。\n君不见临漳此物难复睹，河沉岸坼求者苦。\n县人相传为赝古，呜呼日掘西陵土。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":71,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太白山歌","author":"何景明","text":"我闻太白横西域，百里苍苍见寒色。\n灵源万古谁穷探，雷雨窈冥岩洞黑。\n中峰迢迢直上天，瑶宫玉殿开云烟。\n千盘万折不到顶，石壁铁锁空高悬。\n阴崖皑皑积古雪，绝壑长松几摧折。\n鸟道斜穿剑阁云，龙潭倒映峨嵋月。\n高僧出世人不知，飞仙凌空笙鹤随。\n洞天福地在只尺，怅望尘海令心悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":72,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子昂画马歌","author":"何景明","text":"学士宋王孙，画马皆龙姿。\n曾写飞黄出天厩，尚留云影落瑶池。\n池头马官锦靴裤，缓鞚长牵时拂顾。\n万里精神开绢素，百年毛鬣生风雾。\n吁嗟内乘无人识，想见奔腾过都国。\n翠仗朱轩数往来，金羁玉勒增颜色。\n只今天子罢南征，又闻东巡辽海城。\n安得四马忽然生，登台一顾千金轻，天上常随八骏行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":73,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"避雨山合舍望见蒲圻县","author":"何景明","text":"向晚蒲圻道，遥闻鸡犬喧。\n斜光入深巷，疏雨过闲门。\n县市浑依水，人烟只类村。\n萧条灯火夕，沽酒共谁论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":74,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"景港渡","author":"何景明","text":"秋临景港渡，澄波生绿苔。\n舟移远岸动，帆挂好风来。\n斜日画旂捲，中流清吹哀。\n榜人歌未罢，前导已相催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":75,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辰溪县","author":"何景明","text":"早发辰溪渡，清川喜泛舟。\n山城欹粉堞，江驿映朱楼。\n雨骤沙颓岸，天寒冰露洲。\n蛮音闻渐异，迢递动乡愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":76,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沅水驿四首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"小驿孤城外，阴森草树幽。\n晚凉凭水榭，秋雨坐江楼。\n绝域鸿难到，空山客独愁。\n夜深归渡少，渔火照汀舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":77,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沅水驿四首 其二","author":"何景明","text":"去国日以远，登楼思故乡。\n雨来江气白，日出市烟黄。\n岛屿秋逾静，轩窗晚更凉。\n凭高凝伫久，槐影下微阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":78,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沅水驿四首 其三","author":"何景明","text":"长剑向灯看，休歌行路难。\n岩窗悬石溜，江槛杀风湍。\n城古蒹葭夕，堂空蟋蟀寒。\n几回青琐闼，朝罢想鸣鸾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":79,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沅水驿四首 其四","author":"何景明","text":"江上西风起，萧条暮雨频。\n山楼连堞垒，郡路入荆榛。\n怀古过沅水，悲秋吊楚臣。\n芷香堪采掇，思寄日边人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":80,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沅州道中四首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"山行多雅兴，十里几人家。\n林叶垂朱实，蹊藤落紫花。\n缘崖防转石，傍岸畏颓沙。\n不见前溪堡，遥闻奏暮笳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":81,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沅州道中四首 其二","author":"何景明","text":"岁月惊长道，风尘惜旧绨。\n钩云盘曲磴，沿月溯回溪。\n南国疲征敛，西戎厌鼓鼙。\n山深正愁绝，落日鹧鸪啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":82,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沅州道中四首 其三","author":"何景明","text":"共说关门险，岧峣不可攀。\n山峰藏曲折，涧道泻潺湲。\n绝壁人愁下，长林鸟倦还。\n官程元有限，行旅敢辞艰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":83,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沅州道中四首 其四","author":"何景明","text":"向夕人烟近，肩舆历翠微。\n驿花明去节，山雾上征衣。\n果熟收梨枣，蔬香煮蕨薇。\n开樽对佳客，且喜吏人稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":84,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清浪","author":"何景明","text":"驻旌清浪卫，半日费攀跻。\n窗迥开千嶂，城高控九溪。\n征徭无楚户，耕种有蛮妻。\n愁问滇南道，迢迢隔岭西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":85,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李参谋府二首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"参谋开夕宴，邀我坐深更。\n暇日游观少，清时号令平。\n旌旗巡哨堡，鼓角启严城。\n莫笑书生腐，樽前解论兵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":86,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李参谋府二首 其二","author":"何景明","text":"高衙赫弘厂，镇坐抚南蛮。\n画戟环千士，雕甍插万山。\n秋高鼍鼓振，风静虎旗闲。\n闻道西戎乱，将军莫破颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":87,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"镇远三首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"古郡青山下，经过驻使车。\n土官迎诏拜，蛮客望城遮。\n叠嶂营孤垒，清江绕百家。\n晚来官署里，独坐咏皇华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":88,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"镇远三首 其三","author":"何景明","text":"寥落古城池，斜光照戍旗。\n关临苗子砦，洞入长官司。\n殊俗终难近，蛮音久易知。\n踟蹰暮江上，又是仲秋时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":89,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"查城十五夜对月五首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"中秋看月色，移席近前楹。\n河汉三更没，关山万里明。\n风烟依独戍，砧杵闭空城。\n此夜高堂上，多应念远征。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":90,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"查城十五夜对月五首 其二","author":"何景明","text":"天上何所有，团团白玉盘。\n可怜秋半月，只是客中看。\n影直朱楼午，轮高青嶂寒。\n美人何处共，光彩隔云端。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":91,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"查城十五夜对月五首 其三","author":"何景明","text":"驿舍山东下，闲吟月出歌。\n婆娑笼夕桂，窈窕入云萝。\n玉魄中天满，清辉近水多。\n广寒高几许，台殿锁嫦娥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":92,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"查城十五夜对月五首 其四","author":"何景明","text":"小市无兼味，邻家酒亦悭。\n佳期三五夕，远客万重山。\n霄汉分秋色，风尘照旅颜。\n去年当此夜，坐对紫薇间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":93,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"查城十五夜对月五首 其五","author":"何景明","text":"我爱秋宵永，西林待月斜。\n百年几圆缺，今夜倍光华。\n兄姊俱殊土，田庐有旧家。\n金波如客泪，独洒向天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":94,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安南","author":"何景明","text":"崎岖踰岭路，到郭已昏钟。\n城险苗难近，关高贾不通。\n郊烟秋牧马，崖日暖收蜂。\n民俗殊中域，生涯亦颇同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":95,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送孙教谕","author":"何景明","text":"三年别燕市，万里喜相寻。\n禄少供亲膳，官清任士林。\n板舆迎白发，芹舍拥青衿。\n莫谓蟠龙久，风云起碧岑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":96,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"永宁舟中","author":"何景明","text":"霜降水还漕，舟行不觉劳。\n顺风欹浪疾，乱石下滩高。\n渔舫依红蓼，人家住白茅。\n乡园待归客，应已熟香醪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":97,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江门","author":"何景明","text":"小店江门市，孤舟闻暮砧。\n远沙含细雨，缺岸隐疏林。\n旅宿青枫晚，人烟翠狱深。\n渐临巴蜀道，一慰望乡心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":98,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滟滪","author":"何景明","text":"霜落夔门树，寒江滟滪孤。\n狂澜须此障，砥柱赖谁扶。\n入峡愁孤客，当关用一夫。\n何劳念西域，千载固舆图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":99,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峡中","author":"何景明","text":"自昔偏安地，于令息战侵。\n江穿巫峡隘，山凿鬼门深。\n浊浪鱼龙黑，寒天日月阴。\n夜猿啼不尽，凄断故乡心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":100,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅行","author":"何景明","text":"日暮行湘水，春深别上都。\n系舟南斗近，倚剑北云孤。\n骨肉千行泪，风尘万里躯。\n王孙江上草，何处采蘼芜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":101,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滹沱河上","author":"何景明","text":"长堤枕春郭，断岸入残晖。\n栖鸟张灯起，惊凫解缆飞。\n古人堪堕泪，吾道岂常非。\n未识临河意，中流击枻归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":102,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渡淮","author":"何景明","text":"津口风翻旆，春阴郁未开。\n淮流冲古岸，沙店倚长台。\n鸟向平芜下，人随返照回。\n未忘舟楫兴，临路独迟徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":103,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠刘大参","author":"何景明","text":"自识文翁化，佳声满大藩。\n野人看露冕，稚子望行轩。\n草色青春细，棠阴白昼繁。\n东风应有意，先到宛陵原。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":104,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄阴舍人","author":"何景明","text":"卧病春城暮，相思汝水浔。\n紫薇鸾掖远，碧草凤池深。\n鸣佩他年梦，看花此日心。\n故知俱散尽，北望一沾巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":105,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨霁","author":"何景明","text":"断雨悬深壁，馀雷振远空。\n苍林横落日，碧涧下残虹。\n万井波光静，千家树色同。\n何因共朋好，归咏舞雩风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":106,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨","author":"何景明","text":"独坐浮云起，徘徊夕照孤。\n长风生远树，细雨入平芜。\n暗牖飞虫落，高林宿鸟呼。\n昭回曾有倡，此日慰田夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":107,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸣蝉","author":"何景明","text":"仲夏鸣蝉集，窗临碧树阴。\n清心吾爱尔，长日自悲吟。\n露叶朝栖静，风林夕响沉。\n偶通观物理，幽意坐来深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":108,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送孙太守","author":"何景明","text":"五马朝天日，倾城出饯时。\n倪宽行考最，何武去留思。\n碧草朱轮动，青云皂盖移。\n圣朝崇汉吏，功业正当期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":109,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五月望月食","author":"何景明","text":"月食逢中夏，山城黯黯阴。\n孤灯今夕泪，哀角万方心。\n雾嶂看初灭，风帘望转沉。\n清光无远复，斋坐及更深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":110,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"葵","author":"何景明","text":"春后群花尽，孤葵且自芳。\n弱茎依井上，劲干拂檐长。\n卫足全生理，倾心倚太阳。\n幸因佳客至，采掇荐中堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":111,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立秋寄献吉","author":"何景明","text":"山城一叶下，水榭已迎秋。\n夜迥商风至，天空大火流。\n稍苏司马病，翻遣宋生愁。\n日暮关河外，思君重倚楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":112,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄樊国宾","author":"何景明","text":"不见樊卿久，空怜岁月长。\n爱书王逸少，癖画米元章。\n业绍青缃旧，名沾玉牒香。\n十年相会地，烧烛对秋堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":113,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沱西别业","author":"何景明","text":"使君方拥郡，别业枕沱湄。\n城倚章华殿，山藏大禹祠。\n赌棋怜谢传，看画忆王维。\n未是悬车日，烟云入梦思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":114,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东昌公哀词 其一","author":"何景明","text":"壮志空寥廓，中年与世辞。\n露寒青草梦，风惨紫荆悲。\n入政光前辈，传经实我师。\n大苏碑不忝，惭继子由词。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":115,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东昌公哀词 其二","author":"何景明","text":"岳城淹六纪，东郡未经年。\n别驾王祥胜，弹琴子贱贤。\n一官犹黑发，万事已黄泉。\n铭石看遗绩，凄凉太史篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":116,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东昌公哀词 其三","author":"何景明","text":"江海悠悠逝，那堪死别情。\n向平婚未毕，皂宰宦初成。\n夜雨原花落，秋风墓草生。\n九京何日返，空复望佳城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":117,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东昌公哀词 其四","author":"何景明","text":"复魄黄河远，归程汝路偏。\n素车临故域，华表立新阡。\n室女啼秋夕，乡人吊墓田。\n萧条风雨候，愁绝对床年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":118,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东昌公哀词 其五","author":"何景明","text":"一自封泉室，偏惊节序除。\n白杨悲北郭，青草蔓飞墟。\n天地存亡里，江湖涕泪馀。\n寂寥身后事，不忍读遗书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":119,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中元夜月","author":"何景明","text":"片月东城上，长风度早秋。\n光临青嶂发，影抱碧潭流。\n灏气沉沙浦，馀辉恋水楼。\n何人更吹笛，关塞不胜愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":120,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西郭","author":"何景明","text":"西郭栖迟地，寒山夕景繁。\n鸡豚归故道，鸟雀下秋园。\n开户林风入，沿坡草露翻。\n香粳夜来熟，岁暮足盘飧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":121,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"穫稻","author":"何景明","text":"穫稻妻孥喜，中宵尚筑场。\n但堪供俯仰，那复问仓厢。\n合亩黄云盛，翻匙白雪香。\n更须催酿酒，溪上鲤鱼长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":122,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦何粹夫","author":"何景明","text":"内翰同乡客，新知交更深。\n春从都下别，秋向梦中寻。\n图史留东观，词章侍上林。\n中宵忆颜色，慰我索居心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":123,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚归自溪上","author":"何景明","text":"秋到城西树，缘溪落叶多。\n数家连水竹，一径入烟萝。\n废井寒螀聚，閒窗暮雀过。\n濯缨闻孺子，灯下亦悲歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":124,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客至","author":"何景明","text":"蓬门断来往，草径自荒芜。\n有客何方至，呼儿问浊酤。\n弹琴待风月，把酒话江湖。\n更枉新诗赠，长吟兴不孤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":125,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登楼二首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"眇眇凭高暮，凄凄景物閒。\n秋阴生巨壑，云气度西山。\n一郡寒烟畔，千门落照间。\n此时瞻北极，万里欲飞攀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":126,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登楼二首 其二","author":"何景明","text":"缥缈东楼上，长凭兴不悭。\n病来疏眺望，秋至废跻攀。\n日落河山暮，风回草树斑。\n夜残犹未倦，坐待月临关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":127,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同沈清溪夜坐二首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"细雨侵高树，空堂散郁蒸。\n诗成挥彩笔，话久话青灯。\n凤字惭稽叔，龙门愧李膺。\n瑶琴多古操，数为拂朱绳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":128,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同沈清溪夜坐二首 其二","author":"何景明","text":"移席留长坐，更深雨渐繁。\n竹寒庭鹤警，灯静壁蛩喧。\n舟楫淹归计，琴书代晤言。\n知君多雅兴，常过蒋生园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":129,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨夜似清溪二首 其二","author":"何景明","text":"微雨初摇飏，风吹洒更长。\n冥冥来石壁，飒飒近秋堂。\n萤火流深堑，鸬鹚下浅塘。\n吴歈当此夕，哀切兴难忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":130,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨后邀马君卿","author":"何景明","text":"寂寂扬雄宅，琴书谁与同。\n青山过片雨，白日抱残虹。\n尘榻还堪卧，清樽未可空。\n相看城郭暮，那忍负秋风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":131,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]